           SkillTree._purseLine off the lattice it has just drawn — how many of
           the facets within reach are already yours, or how far off the nearest
           one is. The number on its own answered neither, which is the whole of
           "the Insight economy does not feel like it does anything": a currency
           you cannot price anything in is a score. -->
      <div class="med-insight"><b id="med-insight">0</b><span>Insight</span>
        <i id="med-purse"></i></div>
    </header>
    <div class="med-body">
