           graph; the graph is gone (see SkillTree._draw — the player asked for
           the star chart to be deleted three times) and what stands here is six
           plates of rungs, which is rows in columns and therefore the box
           model's job. An HTML child appended to an <svg> is created in the SVG
           namespace and renders as nothing at all, which is exactly what the
           first attempt at this did. -->
      <div id="med-field" role="group" aria-label="the Holocron"></div>
      <aside class="med-side">
        <div id="med-detail" class="med-detail"></div>
        <button id="btn-med-buy" class="primary" disabled>Commune</button>
        <div id="med-shape" class="med-shape"></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <footer class="med-foot">
      <span class="hint" id="med-hint"></span>
      <button id="btn-med-close" class="secondary">Return</button>
    </footer>
  </div>
