     typed word was invisible in every working build and would have been a lie in
     any build where that write did not happen, on the one prompt a player meets
     mid-fight. It is not inside a `<kbd>`, which is why the sweep in
     tools/checks/controls.mjs never saw it. `—` is the same placeholder
     `keyChips` prints for an action bound to nothing: honest, and never a key
     the player does not have. -->
<div id="commune" class="hidden">
  <div class="commune-ring"><i id="commune-fill"></i></div>
  <span>Hold <b id="commune-key">—</b> to kneel and connect to the Force</span>
  <em id="commune-insight"></em>
